  "text": "18-B. 5. The provisions for vacations established herein shall be effective with vacations given in the calendar year 1981 for work performed in 1980, in the calendar year 1982 for work performed in 1981, in the calendar year 1983 for work performed in 1982 and in the calendar year 1984 up to the termination date of this Agreement for work performed in 1983."
