  "id": "c280",
  "name": "22-D. Interpretation of 2-E. 2 — Memorandum Preamble",
  "text": "Interpretation of 2-E. 2 Over-the-Road Trucking 22-D. This section interprets Section 2-E.2 as 2-E.2 affects The Times: MEMORANDUM During the negotiations leading to the Agreement between The Times and the Union effective March 81, 1970 a committee representing The 91 FUNDO000970 whe cri : all Times and the Union reached certain decisions regarding the interpretation of Section 2-E.2 as it affects The Times. These decisions relate to the future; they are prospective. Until they are in force Section 2-E.2 as written in the Agreement will continue to apply to all existing runs; and the status quo of each existing run until] and if it is phased out will be maintained in all details such as, for example, the present location of transfer points. These decisions are:"
